    narr:sentences (
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """This actor hub holds two registers.""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The long spine is [a single assertion repeated near-daily](narr:Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1) from the first dated entry through [the latest repetition](narr:Expr_20261002_2_E2EDefaultRef1790936131621_hc03e60c98a23_1), with [an alternate dated log](narr:Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1) in the same cadence — claim-level conviction in a concrete, present-tense, realis frame throughout.""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """From late in the span a second register appears: [a ruling issued in an owner capacity](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1), its substance — [one bundle per run per person](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2) — argued in plain-spoken antithesis, [a boundary held against pushback](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), and [a rejected alternative recorded with its reason](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), re-voiced across [a second rendering](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1), [a third](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1), [a fourth](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_1), [a fifth](narr:Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_1), [a sixth](narr:Expr_20260928_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h801a6165fef3_1), and [a seventh](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_2).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The weekly-roll-up ruling extends the register: [a roll-up added on Fridays](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2), with [the run-versus-week scope clarified](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4), [a question about replacement answered](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3), [a daily digest rejected as redundant](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5), and [the same ruling re-voiced](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_2).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """A further rendering of the weekly ruling arrives at the close of the span: [the roll-up rule restated](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_2), with [the replacement question answered again](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_4) and [the daily digest rejected once more](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_5).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """A seventh rendering of the delivery-routing ruling lands on the final dated day: [the owner frame re-set](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_2), [the bundle rule restated](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_3), [the batching-window pushback carried as reported speech](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_4), [the boundary held again](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_5), and [the rejected alternative recorded once more](narr:Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_6).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """A new rendering of the weekly ruling opens the following span: [the roll-up rule restated again](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_2), with [the replacement question answered once more](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_4) and [the daily digest rejected again](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_5).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """An eighth rendering of the delivery-routing ruling follows at the new span's edge: [the owner frame re-set once more](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_1), [the bundle rule restated](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_2), [the pushback carried as reported speech](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_3), and [the rejected alternative recorded again](narr:Expr_20261002_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h3a7c5d6c9593_4).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """A ninth rendering of the weekly ruling closes the span: [the roll-up rule restated once more](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_3), with [the replacement question answered again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_5) and [the daily digest rejected yet again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_6).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """A tenth rendering of the delivery-routing ruling follows at the new span's edge: [the owner frame re-set](narr:Expr_20261004_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h88863a36af14_2), [the bundle rule restated](narr:Expr_20261004_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h88863a36af14_3), [the pushback carried as reported speech](narr:Expr_20261004_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h88863a36af14_4), and [the rejected alternative recorded again](narr:Expr_20261004_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h88863a36af14_5), with [a reviewers line recorded in frontmatter](narr:Expr_20261004_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h88863a36af14_1).""" ]
